    <description><![CDATA[## What is Dr.Claw?

Dr.Claw, from OpenLAIR, is an open source AI science lab: a desktop application of AI researcher agents that plan experiments, run code and write up results.
]]></description>
    <summary>Dr.Claw, from OpenLAIR, is an open source AI science lab: AI researcher agents that plan experiments, run code and write up results.</summary>
